{
  "$comment": "The whole sealed deep_kinds listing as `deep-show kinds --dump` writes it (#412; technical design: the agent-tools paragraph): canonical JSON named by its module-set digest, every registry with its entries, each entry's fields an ordered array with its type, unit, range, whether it takes a list and its default, and its migration records, which `deep-show kinds --diff` reads renames and retirements from.",
